        ("How often should garden maintenance be done in North Lakes?", "<p>Fortnightly mowing through summer with the beds and hedges checked on each visit, a main hedge cut in early spring, a light trim in mid-summer and autumn, and mulch topped up every spring. Most North Lakes gardens stay in covenant condition on a fortnightly summer and monthly winter round.</p>"),
